| ID | Summary | Checklist path | Required role | Blocking |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| H-01 | 评测负责人确认结果只用于小样本路线比较，未包装成统计性能 | acceptance/human/R1-regression-evaluation/checklist.md#h-01 | 评测负责人 | Yes |

